## 💡 Business Insights

- Customers with higher purchase frequency generally generate higher lifetime value.
- Monetary value and recency are strong indicators of future customer value.
- Customer segmentation enables targeted marketing campaigns.
- Predictive analytics can improve customer retention and maximize marketing ROI.

